### Open Project
POST http://localhost:8082/open-project
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "abs_project_path": "/path/to/your/project"
}

### Open File (basic)
POST http://localhost:8082/open-file
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rel_file_path": "flink-table/flink-table-api-java/src/main/java/org/apache/flink/table/catalog/DataTypeFactoryImpl.java"
}

### Open File (basic)
POST http://localhost:8082/open-file
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rel_file_path": "flink-runtime-web/src/main/java/org/apache/flink/runtime/webmonitor/handlers/JarRunRequestBody.java"
}

### Try Open File (with fallback to qualified name)
POST http://localhost:8082/try-open-file
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rel_file_path": "src/main/java/com/example/MyClass.java"
}

### Create New File
POST http://localhost:8082/create-file
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rel_file_path": "src/main/java/com/example/NewClass.java"
}

### Try Create File (with package fallback)
POST http://localhost:8082/try-create-file
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rel_file_path": "src/main/java/com/example/NewClass.java"
}

### Rename Variable/Field/Method
POST http://localhost:8082/rename
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "old_name": "createLatencyTrackingState",
  "new_name": "createMetricsTrackingState",
  "line_num": 94,
  "code_element_type": "method"
}

### Rename Variable/Field/Method
POST http://localhost:8082/rename
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "old_name": "getRestoreMode",
  "new_name": "getRecoveryClaimMode",
  "line_num": 138,
  "code_element_type": "method"
}

### Rename without line number (renames all occurrences)
POST http://localhost:8082/rename
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "old_name": "oldMethodName",
  "new_name": "newMethodName"
}

### Rename with specific code element type
POST http://localhost:8082/rename
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "old_name": "oldFieldName",
  "new_name": "newFieldName",
  "line_num": 15,
  "code_element_type": "field"
}


### Find and Replace Text
POST http://localhost:8082/find_replace
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "find_text": "oldText",
  "replace_text": "newText",
  "replace_in_comments_only": false,
  "line_num": 42
}

### Find and Replace in Comments Only
POST http://localhost:8082/find_replace
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "find_text": "old comment text",
  "replace_text": "new comment text",
  "replace_in_comments_only": true
}

### Update Comment on Specific Line
POST http://localhost:8082/update_comment
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "find_text": "old comment",
  "replace_text": "updated comment",
  "line_num": 10
}

### Search for Symbol (Method, Field, or Class)
POST http://localhost:8082/search_symbol
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "symbol": "resolveQueryHint"
}

### Search for Keyword with Context (Like IntelliJ's "Search Everywhere" Text Tab)
POST http://localhost:8082/search_keyword
Content-Type: application/json

{
"symbol": "executionConfig"
}

### Search for Changed Part from Rename Pair
POST http://localhost:8082/search_symbol_changed
Content-Type: application/json

{
"old_name": "JoinHintResolverTest",
"new_name": "QueryHintsResolverTest"
}

### Search for Changed Part from Rename Pair
POST http://localhost:8082/search_symbol_changed
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "old_name": "executionConfig",
  "new_name": "serializerConfig"
}

### Search for Changed Part from Rename Pair
POST http://localhost:8082/search_symbol_changed
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "old_name": "getAsyncInflightRecordsLimit",
  "new_name": "getAsyncStateTotalBufferSize"
}

### Search for Changed Part from Rename Pair
POST http://localhost:8082/search_symbol_changed
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "old_name": "testCreateMaterializedTableFailed",
  "new_name": "testCreateMaterializedTableFailedInInContinuousMode"
}

### Search for Changed Part from Rename Pair
POST http://localhost:8082/search_symbol_changed
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "old_name": "testHasLeadershipWithLeadershipLostAndRevokeEventProcessed",
  "new_name": "testHasLeadershipAsyncWithLeadershipLostAndRevokeEventProcessed"
}